<title>UK: Eurofima sets 150 million rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 150 million rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0 PCT  MATURITY    10.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC  0.75 PCT  PRAECIPUUM  0.10 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
